/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 46 0 R
/T (Unlike conventional quizzes that rely heavily on memorised facts and obscure knowledge, Utsuk celebrates the art of thinking on your feet. The questions are designed to reward presence of mind, lateral thinking, logical reasoning, and the ability to connect seemingly unrelated pieces of information. From fascinating scientific discoveries and technological innovations to current affairs, intriguing trivia, and unexpected connections, every question offers a chance to look beyond the obvious and arrive at an answer through clever deduction. Here, curiosity can be just as valuable as knowledge, and sometimes, the smallest clue can lead to the biggest breakthrough!)
/E (Unlike conventional quizzes that rely heavily on memorised facts and obscure knowledge, Utsuk celebrates the art of thinking on your feet. The questions are designed to reward presence of mind, lateral thinking, logical reasoning, and the ability to connect seemingly unrelated pieces of information. From fascinating scientific discoveries and technological innovations to current affairs, intriguing trivia, and unexpected connections, every question offers a chance to look beyond the obvious and arrive at an answer through clever deduction. Here, curiosity can be just as valuable as knowledge, and sometimes, the smallest clue can lead to the biggest breakthrough!)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
